NOTE ON REDISTRIBUTED COMPONENTS

This repository's own files (Dockerfile, scripts, rootfs configuration,
compose templates, documentation) are released under the MIT license above.

The container image built from this repository redistributes third-party
software under their own licenses, which remain in force:

- Selkies (https://github.com/selkies-project/selkies) — MPL-2.0
- Ubuntu packages — their respective licenses in the Ubuntu archive
- Microsoft Edge (packages.microsoft.com apt repository) — Microsoft Edge
  software license terms
- ZCode CLI (https://github.com/zai-org/ZCode and its community CLI
  distribution on npm) — Apache-2.0

Building or running the image means you also accept those upstream terms.
